{"observed_at": "2026-11-05T20:31:03.664082+00:00", "provider": "OpenAI Responses API", "requested_model": "gpt-6-sol", "question_id": "G02", "category": "broad_intent", "brand_prompted": false, "prompt": "영어공부하는 법 알려줘.", "repeat": 1, "search_mode": "required web_search, medium, KR", "max_tool_calls": 3, "consumer_chatgpt_measurement": false, "measurement_type": "discovery", "status": "completed", "model": "gpt-6-sol", "answer": "영어공부는 **목적에 맞는 연습을 짧게라도 꾸준히 하는 것**부터 시작하세요. 회화가 목표라면 말하기 시간을, 시험이 목표라면 해당 시험의 문제 풀이 시간을 더 늘리면 됩니다. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/comment/206115?utm_source=openai))\n\n**하루 30분 예시**\n1. **10분 듣기:** 내 수준에 맞는 짧은 영상이나 음성을 듣고, 유용한 표현 2~3개를 고르세요.\n2. **10분 말하기:** 그 표현으로 내 이야기를 만들어 소리 내어 말하고 녹음해 보세요. 녹음을 들으며 막힌 부분을 확인할 수 있습니다. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking?utm_source=openai))\n3. **10분 복습:** 새 표현을 뜻만 다시 읽지 말고, 뜻을 가린 채 *직접 떠올려* 말하거나 써 보세요. 며칠 간격으로 다시 복습하는 방식은 어휘 학습에 도움이 됩니다. ([cambridge.org](https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/studies-in-second-language-acquisition/article/abs/review-of-laboratory-studies-of-adult-second-language-vocabulary-training/18F0A5D1FFC829CE05931B2EEE83124A?utm_source=openai))\n\n처음에는 어려운 자료를 많이 보기보다, **이해할 수 있는 짧은 자료 하나를 듣고 실제로 써 보는 것**에 집중하세요.", "citations": [{"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 208, "start_index": 99, "title": "Planning your English learning | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/comment/206115?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 542, "start_index": 363, "title": "Five tips for busy learners: listening and speaking | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 876, "start_index": 642, "title": "A REVIEW OF LABORATORY STUDIES OF ADULT SECOND LANGUAGE VOCABULARY TRAINING | Studies in Second Language Acquisition | Cambridge Core", "url": "https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/studies-in-second-language-acquisition/article/abs/review-of-laboratory-studies-of-adult-second-language-vocabulary-training/18F0A5D1FFC829CE05931B2EEE83124A?utm_source=openai"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 8706, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 13, "cached_tokens": 4336}, "output_tokens": 361, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 71}, "total_tokens": 9067}, "search_calls": [{"id": "ws_0736d99952d0eadb016aece788e1c887d2b4a5d54537117b80", "type": "web_search_call", "status": "completed", "action": {"type": "search", "queries": ["site:cambridge.org spaced repetition second language vocabulary learning research retrieval practice", "site:britishcouncil.org learn english tips listening speaking daily practice"], "query": "site:cambridge.org spaced repetition second language vocabulary learning research retrieval practice", "sources": [{"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/reading/a2/study-skills-tips"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/level/improve-your-english-level/how-improve-your-english-speaking"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/comment/206115"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/learning-hub"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/studies-in-second-language-acquisition/article/abs/review-of-laboratory-studies-of-adult-second-language-vocabulary-training/18F0A5D1FFC829CE05931B2EEE83124A"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/how-get-your-english-b1-level"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learne