/teachingenglish/examskills/te_exams_listening_easier2.pdf"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://lit-lessons-cdn.duolingo.com/resources/duolingo_abc_scope_and_sequence_english.pdf"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://downloads.bbc.co.uk/webwise/get-connected/listening_online.pdf"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://blog.duolingo.com/ko/listening-skills-duolingo/?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://help.ted.com/hc/en-us/articles/360018572954-How-do-I-find-transcripts-for-TED-and-TEDx-talks?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://blog.elsaspeak.com/en/discover-the-new-elsa-speak-experience/?utm_source=openai"}]}}], "brand_mention_candidate": false, "official_domain_cited": false}
{"observed_at": "2026-11-05T20:31:31.372101+00:00", "provider": "OpenAI Responses API", "requested_model": "gpt-6-sol", "question_id": "G08", "category": "broad_intent", "brand_prompted": false, "prompt": "영어 쉐도잉 공부 방법 알려줘.", "repeat": 1, "search_mode": "required web_search, medium, KR", "max_tool_calls": 3, "consumer_chatgpt_measurement": false, "measurement_type": "discovery", "status": "completed", "model": "gpt-6-sol", "answer": "**영어 쉐도잉은 음성을 들으면서 한 박자 늦게 따라 말하는 연습**입니다. 처음부터 동시에 말하기 어렵다면, 문장마다 멈춰서 따라 한 뒤 익숙해지면 음성을 끄지 않고 따라가세요. ([englishonline.britishcouncil.org](https://englishonline.britishcouncil.org/blog/articles/8-practical-ways-to-practise-speaking-english/?utm_source=openai))\n\n하루 **10분**이면 이렇게 해보세요.\n\n1. **짧은 자료 고르기:** 대본이나 자막이 있는 30초~1분짜리 대화를 고릅니다.\n2. **듣고 뜻 파악하기:** 모르는 표현을 확인하고, 어디서 끊어 말하는지 들어봅니다.\n3. **따라 말하기:** 처음엔 한 문장씩 멈춰서, 다음엔 음성과 함께 말합니다. 단어뿐 아니라 **강세·리듬·억양**도 흉내 내세요. ([takeielts.britishcouncil.org](https://takeielts.britishcouncil.org/blog/how-to-improve-english-pronunciation-ielts-speaking?utm_source=openai))\n4. **녹음해 비교하기:** 원음과 내 녹음을 듣고 차이가 큰 부분 **하나만** 골라 다시 연습합니다. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking?utm_source=openai))\n\n핵심은 긴 영상을 한 번 따라 하기보다, **짧은 구간을 이해하고 여러 번 따라 하는 것**입니다.", "citations": [{"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 258, "start_index": 101, "title": "8 Practical Ways to Practise Speaking English", "url": "https://englishonline.britishcouncil.org/blog/articles/8-practical-ways-to-practise-speaking-english/?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 606, "start_index": 461, "title": "How to Improve Pronunciation in IELTS Speaking: Band 7+ Tips | British Council IELTS", "url": "https://takeielts.britishcouncil.org/blog/how-to-improve-english-pronunciation-ielts-speaking?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 846, "start_index": 667, "title": "Five tips for busy learners: listening and speaking | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking?utm_source=openai"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 8643, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 16, "cached_tokens": 4336}, "output_tokens": 383, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 74}, "total_tokens": 9026}, "search_calls": [{"id": "ws_02cf74b563b23847016aece7a4ab4087d2a7bf765c3dab7d20", "type": "web_search_call", "status": "completed", "action": {"type": "search", "queries": ["site:britishcouncil.org shadowing technique English speaking practice listen repeat", "site:cambridge.org language learning shadowing pronunciation listening research"], "query": "site:britishcouncil.org shadowing technique English speaking practice listen repeat", "sources": [{"type": "url", "url": "https://englishonline.britishcouncil.org/blog/articles/8-practical-ways-to-practise-speaking-english/"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://takeielts.britishcouncil.org/blog/how-to-improve-english-pronunciation-ielts-speaking"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://takeielts.britishcouncil.org/blog/english-immersion-english-language-learning"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglishteens.britishcouncil.org/exams/listening-exams/how-many-times-will-you-listen"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://americas.britishcouncil.org/new-ways-of-teaching/events/teaching-english-pronunciation-online"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://americas.britishcouncil.org/sites/default/files/nwot_collection_2022-2023.pdf"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/level/improve-your-english-level/how-improve-your-english-speaking"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://takeielts.britishcouncil.org/blog/how-to-prepare-for-ielts-at-home"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/level/improve-your-english-level/how-can-i-improve-my-english-pronunciation"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://www.cambridge.org/core/services/aop-cambridge-core/content/view/EDADBFA61E348C389BF7EE9EACCFE4E2/S026144482510102Xa.pdf/div-class-title-phonological-acquisition-in-instructed-sla-l2-pronunciation-training-in-and-beyond-the-classroom-and-individual-differences-div.pdf"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://americas.britishcouncil.org/sites/default/files/bbelt-conference_programme.pdf"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/language-teaching/article/phonological-acquisition-in-instructed-sla-l2-pronunciation-training-in-and-beyond-the-classroom-and-individual-differences/EDADBFA61E348C389BF7EE9EACCFE4E2"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://takeielts.britishcouncil.org/prepare/ielts-academic/speaking"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/recall/article/effectiveness-of-automatic-speech-recognition-in-eslefl-pronunciation-a-metaanalysis/A915444CF252B61D14961D2FE733822D"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://assets.cambridge.org/97805217/18141/excerpt/9780521718141_excerpt.pdf"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglishteens.britishcouncil.org/sites/teens/files/information_gap_-_tips_1.pdf"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/sites/podcasts/files/LearnEnglish-Speaking-A1-Talking-about-other-people.pdf"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://englishonline.britishcouncil.org/blog/articles/8-practical-ways-to-practise-speaking-english/?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://takeielts.britishcouncil.org/blog/how-to-improve-english-pronunciation-ielts-speaking?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking?utm_source=openai"}]}}], "brand_mention_candidate": false, "official_domain_cited": false}
{"observed_at": "2026-11-05T20:31:41.714012+00:00", "provider": "OpenAI Responses API", "requested_model": "gpt-6-sol", "question_id": "G09", "category": "broad_intent", "brand_prompted": false, "prompt": "출퇴근하면서 영어 공부할 방법 추천해줘.", "repeat": 1, "search_mode": "required web_search, medium, KR", "max_tool_calls": 3, "consumer_chatgpt_measurement": false, "measurement_type": "discovery", "status": "completed", "model": "gpt-6-sol", "answer": "출퇴근길에는 **한 가지 짧은 음원을 반복해서 듣는 방식**을 추천해요. 이동 중에도 꾸준히 하기 쉽습니다.\n\n- **출근길:** 내 수준에 맞는 5~10분짜리 영어 음원을 듣고, 무슨 내용인지 한 문장으로 떠올려 보세요. 처음부터 모든 단어를 알아들으려 하지 않아도 됩니다. 영국문화원에는 수준별 듣기 자료가 있습니다. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/listening?utm_source=openai))\n- **퇴근길:** 같은 음원을 다시 듣고, 기억하고 싶은 표현 **한두 개만** 골라 따라 말해 보세요. 대본이 있는 팟캐스트를 쓰면 못 들은 부분을 나중에 확인하기 좋습니다. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/general-english/audio-series/podcasts?utm_source=openai))\n- **주말 5분:** 그 표현으로 자신의 출퇴근이나 업무에 관한 문장 하나를 만들어 보세요.\n\n**운전 중이라면 화면이나 대본은 보지 말고 듣기만** 하세요. 대중교통에서도 소리 내기 어렵다면 속으로 따라 말하면 됩니다.", "citations": [{"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 299, "start_index": 180, "title": "Practise English listening skills | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/listening?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 532, "start_index": 400, "title": "Podcasts | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/general-english/audio-series/podcasts?utm_source=openai"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 8746, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 16, "cached_tokens": 4336}, "output_tokens": 341, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 75}, "total_tokens": 9087}, "search_calls": [{"id": "ws_09265ea10d7682a1016aece7aeff3887d2acca68378579dda8", "type": "web_search_call", "status": "completed", "action": {"type": "search", "queries": ["site:britishcouncil.org learnenglish podcasts listening practice commute Eng